WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 26

01:42.900 --> 01:44.880
Dad, you want to see me.

01:45.050 --> 01:46.240
You're back.

01:46.260 --> 01:47.640
Come and take a seat.

01:51.410 --> 01:52.560
The negotiation

01:52.580 --> 01:53.960
in Court of State Ceremonials is over.

01:53.980 --> 01:56.920
Be cautious at the Hall tomorrow.

01:57.330 --> 01:58.630
You mean

01:58.650 --> 02:00.600
the banquet tomorrow night?

02:01.860 --> 02:03.600
What's wrong?

02:05.690 --> 02:07.680
It's known to the world that

02:07.820 --> 02:10.760
literary giants are all in Beiqi.

02:10.780 --> 02:12.200
In earlier years,

02:12.450 --> 02:14.240
scholars actually found it an honor

02:14.260 --> 02:17.480
to pass the imperial examinations in Beiqi.

02:17.700 --> 02:19.190
Though things are better these years,

02:19.210 --> 02:21.040
when it comes to scholars,

02:21.060 --> 02:24.320
Nanqing is no match to Beiqi.

02:24.340 --> 02:28.070
Now the Nanqing literary circles

02:28.090 --> 02:30.170
have anchored their hopes on you.

02:32.450 --> 02:33.810
Me?

02:34.540 --> 02:35.970
The literary circles?

02:36.570 --> 02:38.160
That poem with the line

02:38.180 --> 02:40.120
“A thousand miles from home, I'm grieved at
autumn's plight” which you wrote a few days ago

02:40.140 --> 02:41.450
is rated as the No.1 Current Seven-character Poem

02:41.450 --> 02:44.450
by scholars of Nanqing.

02:45.980 --> 02:48.240
Many say in private that

02:48.260 --> 02:50.960
accomplished at such a young age,

02:50.980 --> 02:54.010
you can be better than Zhuang Mohan in future.

02:54.010 --> 02:55.630
I just wrote one poem.

02:55.650 --> 02:57.070
They are too hasty in drawing the conclusion.

02:57.090 --> 02:59.040
One poem is not much,

02:59.060 --> 03:01.760
but we've longed for a talented scholar

03:01.780 --> 03:03.890
for so long.

03:04.010 --> 03:06.760
We may even fight a losing battle.

03:07.060 --> 03:08.040
Who will lose?

03:08.060 --> 03:10.170
You, of course.

03:10.420 --> 03:12.160
So tomorrow night,

03:12.180 --> 03:14.910
everyone will watch me

03:14.930 --> 03:17.880
meeting the literary giant

03:17.900 --> 03:19.690
Zhuang Mohan.

03:20.140 --> 03:22.830
You don't need to be amazing.

03:22.850 --> 03:26.040
Just play it safe.

03:26.260 --> 03:28.170
That's enough.

03:30.370 --> 03:32.040
Will you go tomorrow night?

03:32.290 --> 03:34.330
The banquet tomorrow

03:34.700 --> 03:35.980
is especially set for Court of State Ceremonials

03:35.980 --> 03:37.760
and Board of Rites.

03:37.780 --> 03:40.120
I'm the Assistant Minister of Ministry of Revenue.

03:40.140 --> 03:41.920
Why would I go?

03:43.450 --> 03:44.810
Don't worry.

03:45.420 --> 03:47.330
Just a little advice.

03:47.930 --> 03:50.200
Respected as Zhuang Mohan is,

03:50.260 --> 03:51.450
why would he actually make things difficult

03:51.450 --> 03:53.810
for a young man like you?

04:32.820 --> 04:35.910
Fan Xian will also attend the banquet tomorrow night.

04:35.930 --> 04:39.920
Master Zhuang, please ruin his name.

04:59.370 --> 05:01.200
You've hung up a red lantern.

05:01.330 --> 05:04.030
Uncle, for all these years,

05:04.050 --> 05:05.590
I've been wondering

05:05.610 --> 05:07.470
whether you can see or not.

05:07.490 --> 05:08.540
How come you know

05:08.540 --> 05:09.190
I hang up a lantern?

05:09.210 --> 05:10.810
And you even know the color.

05:11.260 --> 05:13.010
It's hard for me to explain.

05:14.370 --> 05:16.160
I can know everything.

05:16.820 --> 05:19.090
But I don't see with eyes.

05:20.260 --> 05:21.720
You see with your heart.

05:21.740 --> 05:23.640
I don't know how to put it.

05:25.860 --> 05:26.910
Uncle.

05:26.930 --> 05:28.540
I find you mysterious all the time.

05:28.540 --> 05:30.030
If anyone dares to piss you off,

05:30.050 --> 05:32.200
he's definitely dice with death.

05:36.650 --> 05:38.160
Take a seat. Take a seat. Take a seat.

05:42.260 --> 05:44.090
Let's get down to business.

05:44.930 --> 05:45.930
Tomorrow night,

05:45.930 --> 05:47.870
the imperial family will hold a banquet at
the Hall of Prayer for Good Harvest.

05:47.890 --> 05:49.410
The Hall of Prayer for Good Harvest?

05:49.580 --> 05:51.240
How is Wang Qinian involved?
(Qinian sounds like Prayer for Good Harvest in Chinese)

05:51.260 --> 05:52.190
Who?

05:52.210 --> 05:53.640
Wang Qinian.

05:54.980 --> 05:56.250
Uncle,

05:56.610 --> 05:58.440
besides being mysterious,

05:58.460 --> 05:59.370
how come your thoughts

05:59.370 --> 06:00.760
are so hard to follow recently?

06:01.210 --> 06:02.480
Thoughts?

06:05.260 --> 06:08.800
I don't think the Hall of Prayer for Good Harvest

06:08.820 --> 06:10.410
has anything to do with Wang Qinian.

06:10.700 --> 06:11.840
Fine.

06:11.860 --> 06:13.440
Let's get down to business.

06:14.170 --> 06:15.820
The banquet tomorrow is mainly for

06:15.820 --> 06:18.970
the celebration of finishing the war against Beiqi.

06:19.050 --> 06:20.720
It's kind of a big event.

06:21.740 --> 06:22.460
Aren't you going to ask me

06:22.460 --> 06:24.240
why I ask you over?

06:24.260 --> 06:27.040
Aren't you going to tell me if I don't ask?

06:29.460 --> 06:31.370
You've made a point.

06:32.540 --> 06:33.640
Fine.

06:34.050 --> 06:35.590
After the banquet tomorrow night,

06:35.610 --> 06:37.000
we'll break into the imperial harem.

06:37.020 --> 06:38.250
Are you sure?

06:39.420 --> 06:40.440
Everyone will relax

06:40.460 --> 06:41.970
after a great event.

06:42.300 --> 06:43.910
OK, the plan remains unchanged.

06:43.930 --> 06:45.470
I will lure away Hong Sixiang,

06:45.490 --> 06:46.820
and you should sneak into the Empress Dowager's palace

06:46.820 --> 06:47.800
to find the key.

06:47.820 --> 06:49.070
There's one last problem.

06:49.090 --> 06:50.050
I don't know

06:50.050 --> 06:51.590
where the Empress Dowager keeps the key.

06:51.610 --> 06:54.120
It might take time to find it.

06:54.140 --> 06:55.910
There's a secret compartment

06:55.930 --> 06:57.440
on the bed board under her pillow.

06:57.460 --> 07:00.090
All her important things are kept there.

07:00.300 --> 07:01.600
How do you know that?

07:02.020 --> 07:03.810
Your mom searched it before.

07:04.770 --> 07:05.590
Why did my mom

07:05.610 --> 07:07.090
search her secret compartment?

07:09.890 --> 07:11.910
The old lady has lived in widowhood for so many years.

07:11.930 --> 07:13.590
Though she looks serious,

07:13.610 --> 07:14.960
I wonder whether she keeps

07:14.980 --> 07:17.010
love letters in private or not.

07:19.610 --> 07:22.250
Those are the words said by your mom back then.

07:23.300 --> 07:25.070
So she searched the Empress Dowager's

07:25.090 --> 07:27.600
secret compartment only for gossiping!

07:27.820 --> 07:28.700
I've no idea

07:28.700 --> 07:30.320
what gossiping implies,

07:30.420 --> 07:32.280
but yes, you're right.

07:32.300 --> 07:33.350
Didn't she get caught?

07:33.370 --> 07:35.200
I kept watch for her.

07:40.090 --> 07:41.480
Why are you laughing?

07:42.300 --> 07:43.170
Words can't express

07:43.170 --> 07:45.250
my feelings right now.

07:45.420 --> 07:46.810
What feelings?

07:47.260 --> 07:48.470
Just forget it.

07:48.490 --> 07:49.910
Anyway, back then,

07:49.930 --> 07:50.540
my mom had solved

07:50.540 --> 07:51.750
the biggest problem for me.

07:51.770 --> 07:53.010
Now,

07:53.090 --> 07:54.960
as long as I know where the key is,

07:54.980 --> 07:56.920
I feel quite sure of getting it out.

07:57.460 --> 07:58.800
If we take the key,

07:58.820 --> 08:00.350
the old lady might notice.

08:00.370 --> 08:01.870
We'd better put in a fake one.

08:01.890 --> 08:03.350
Without seeing the real key,

08:03.370 --> 08:05.280
how could you make a fake one in advance?

08:05.300 --> 08:06.470
I've got an idea.

08:06.490 --> 08:07.520
Good.

08:07.540 --> 08:10.040
Wait for me here tomorrow night.

08:11.930 --> 08:13.570
Someone's here.

08:14.700 --> 08:16.040
I asked him over.

08:16.460 --> 08:17.880
Seriously?

08:21.700 --> 08:22.330
Your Excellency.

08:22.330 --> 08:23.570
Come in.

08:24.020 --> 08:25.190
It's quite late now.

08:25.210 --> 08:26.800
Do you have anything for me?

08:26.820 --> 08:28.320
I have a question for you.

08:28.770 --> 08:30.160
Please go ahead.

08:31.050 --> 08:34.330
Do you have anything to do with the
Hall of Prayer for Good Harvest?

08:34.900 --> 08:36.810
I suppose not.

08:37.730 --> 08:39.160
I think so.

08:39.730 --> 08:41.100
What's wrong?

08:41.100 --> 08:42.600
Nothing.

08:43.780 --> 08:45.160
Take a seat.

08:45.290 --> 08:46.470
Your Excellency, thank you.

08:46.490 --> 08:47.890
I might as well stand.

08:53.580 --> 08:54.470
Your Excellency,

08:54.490 --> 08:56.020
I heard that by deterring the Beiqi mission

08:56.020 --> 08:57.800
in the Court of State Ceremonials,

08:57.820 --> 09:00.570
you've made great contributions to Nanqing.

09:00.760 --> 09:01.370
=Ten taels of silver=

09:01.370 --> 09:03.370
I will attend the banquet tomorrow night.

09:03.370 --> 09:04.710
Your Excellency, charismatic and vigorous as you are,

09:04.730 --> 09:06.460
you'll definitely be promoted in the near future.

09:06.460 --> 09:07.530
Is this for me?

09:07.530 --> 09:08.770
Yes.

09:08.820 --> 09:10.600
Thank you, Your Excellency.

09:14.410 --> 09:15.560
Your Excellency,

09:15.580 --> 09:17.200
next time you grant me a reward,

09:17.220 --> 09:18.640
please grant me bank notes instead.

09:18.660 --> 09:20.120
They are easier to hide.

09:20.140 --> 09:21.930
I want to break into the imperial harem at night.

09:21.930 --> 09:23.080
Your Excellency,

09:23.900 --> 09:24.680
pardon, please?

09:24.700 --> 09:27.120
I said I want to break into the imperial harem at night

09:27.140 --> 09:29.240
and sneak into the Empress Dowager's palace

09:29.260 --> 09:31.030
to steal a key.

09:31.050 --> 09:31.820
Of course,

09:31.820 --> 09:33.350
for fear the old lady might notice,

09:33.370 --> 09:35.020
I have to make a fake key overnight

09:35.020 --> 09:35.680
to replace the real one.

09:35.700 --> 09:37.400
That's my plan.

09:38.900 --> 09:40.470
Are you kidding me?

09:40.490 --> 09:41.320
Not really.

09:41.340 --> 09:43.560
Are you serious?

09:43.580 --> 09:44.840
Yes.

09:47.140 --> 09:50.040
It's a deadly sin which could implicate your family.

09:50.660 --> 09:52.040
I suppose it is.

09:52.610 --> 09:53.930
Then why do you

09:53.930 --> 09:55.510
tell me about it?

09:55.530 --> 09:57.160
I just told you

09:57.220 --> 09:58.220
I have to make a fake key

09:58.220 --> 09:59.150
overnight.

09:59.170 --> 10:01.030
I have to find the best locksmith in the capital city.

10:01.050 --> 10:02.270
Since I'm not familiar with the capital city,

10:02.290 --> 10:03.680
I need someone with connections.

10:03.700 --> 10:05.210
That's you.

10:09.220 --> 10:10.850
If I'm involved,

10:10.850 --> 10:12.690
I will also commit a deadly sin.

10:12.970 --> 10:14.530
You just find me a locksmith

10:14.530 --> 10:15.590
to make a key.

10:15.610 --> 10:16.800
You know nothing else.

10:16.820 --> 10:17.800
Right!

10:17.820 --> 10:19.170
Then you should only ask me

10:19.170 --> 10:20.080
to find a locksmith.

10:20.100 --> 10:21.410
Right? Why tell me

10:21.410 --> 10:22.170
the whole plan?

10:22.170 --> 10:24.150
I also want to tell you less,

10:24.170 --> 10:25.720
but I can't.

10:26.220 --> 10:27.660
You have to wait for me

10:27.660 --> 10:29.480
outside the imperial palace tomorrow.

10:29.970 --> 10:31.400
Your Excellency!

10:35.410 --> 10:37.290
Aren't you afraid that I might tell on you?

10:37.290 --> 10:38.660
Do you really want to

10:38.660 --> 10:40.020
trust me

10:40.020 --> 10:41.350
with your life?

10:41.370 --> 10:43.010
Of course I do.

10:43.170 --> 10:44.800
You're a wise man.

10:44.820 --> 10:46.480
You should know that

10:46.780 --> 10:49.810
you only need to take a little risk by helping me,

10:49.970 --> 10:53.400
but you'll get yourself killed if you dare betray me.

10:54.290 --> 10:55.810
What do you mean?

10:56.020 --> 10:56.970
You know how Chen Pingping

10:56.970 --> 10:58.200
treats me.

10:58.220 --> 11:00.690
The Head treats you like his son.

11:03.140 --> 11:04.890
So this is the case.

11:07.290 --> 11:08.490
If I tell on you

11:08.490 --> 11:09.760
and get you killed,

11:09.780 --> 11:11.660
the Head will definitely

11:11.660 --> 11:13.960
cut me into pieces.

11:14.340 --> 11:16.520
You're really wise.

11:17.020 --> 11:18.220
Then why don't you ask the Head

11:18.220 --> 11:19.470
to do you the favor.

11:19.490 --> 11:20.970
It's inconvenient for big potatoes

11:20.970 --> 11:22.600
to do such things.

11:27.050 --> 11:28.050
What can I say?

11:28.050 --> 11:29.000
The choice is yours.

11:29.020 --> 11:30.920
I know a good locksmith.

11:30.970 --> 11:33.390
Good. Ask him to wait for me tomorrow night.

11:33.410 --> 11:34.650
OK.

11:35.580 --> 11:36.490
From tonight on,

11:36.490 --> 11:38.770
I'll raise your salary by another ten taels of silver.

11:39.850 --> 11:41.660
This is something that might get my entire family killed.

11:41.660 --> 11:42.660
You only add ten taels of silver?!

11:42.660 --> 11:43.820
Don't you think it's too little?

11:43.820 --> 11:44.410
So you don't want it?

11:44.410 --> 11:45.960
I want it.

11:46.850 --> 11:48.960
Give me bank notes instead next time.

11:59.700 --> 12:01.600
What time is it now?

12:02.140 --> 12:03.650
It's about 1:00 p.m.

12:06.100 --> 12:09.080
Is the Hall of Prayer for Good Harvest ready?

12:09.100 --> 12:11.100
Yes, they started decorating

12:11.100 --> 12:12.690
early this morning.

12:15.530 --> 12:17.400
Find me a place for the night banquet.

12:18.530 --> 12:19.610
It's only held for Court of State Ceremonials

12:19.610 --> 12:20.910
and Board of Rites.

12:20.930 --> 12:22.560
It's no big deal.

12:22.580 --> 12:24.040
Just do it.

12:24.490 --> 12:25.840
Yes.

12:28.780 --> 12:30.570
I can't wait.

12:37.580 --> 12:38.640
I've asked.

12:38.660 --> 12:39.710
As to the night banquet in the
Hall of Prayer for Good Harvest,

12:39.730 --> 12:41.570
guests can take seats at about 5:00 p.m.

12:44.930 --> 12:47.150
Your Highness, if you eat too much now,

12:47.170 --> 12:47.660
you won't feel like eating

12:47.660 --> 12:49.450
in the banquet.

12:50.170 --> 12:51.600
On such banquets,

12:52.170 --> 12:53.510
there will be a lot of drinking and praises.

12:53.530 --> 12:55.080
How could I fill my belly?

12:55.580 --> 12:56.560
That's right.

12:56.580 --> 12:57.560
Such banquets

12:57.580 --> 12:59.130
are merely a formality.

12:59.290 --> 13:00.580
Your Highness really don't

13:00.580 --> 13:01.960
have to go.

13:02.530 --> 13:04.530
Fan Xian completed his first task successfully.

13:04.530 --> 13:05.340
I certainly should

13:05.340 --> 13:07.130
congratulate him in person.

13:08.020 --> 13:10.220
Hasn't Fan Xian taken the side of

13:10.220 --> 13:12.080
the Crown Prince?

13:16.140 --> 13:17.600
Who told you so?

13:17.700 --> 13:19.280
If not, why would the Crown Prince

13:19.460 --> 13:22.160
send him to negotiate with the Beiqi mission?

13:23.020 --> 13:24.890
Man like Fan Xian

13:25.220 --> 13:27.160
won't follow the Crown Prince willingly.

13:30.340 --> 13:32.160
I've only met Fan Xian a few times,

13:33.460 --> 13:35.080
but I find him a bosom friend.

13:35.930 --> 13:39.810
Just like me, Fan Xian won't feel content

13:41.100 --> 13:43.250
to occupy a position below others.

14:00.140 --> 14:02.570
How long has His Highness stood there?

14:02.820 --> 14:04.520
About an hour.

14:04.610 --> 14:07.440
His Highness is afraid to form folds on his gown.

14:07.460 --> 14:09.160
What time is it now?

14:09.290 --> 14:11.680
Your Highness, it's about 5:00 p.m.

14:11.700 --> 14:13.150
Let's go to the Hall of Prayer for Good Harvest.

14:13.170 --> 14:14.520
Yes.

14:20.900 --> 14:22.700
Master Zhuang, the carriage is ready.

14:22.700 --> 14:24.130
We're ready to go.

14:24.700 --> 14:26.720
Let me take this for you.

14:41.100 --> 14:44.330
Your Excellency, I've talked with the locksmith.

14:46.580 --> 14:48.480
Good. Let's go drinking.

15:13.220 --> 15:14.600
Your Excellency Fan!

15:14.900 --> 15:16.130
Your Excellency Fan!

15:16.340 --> 15:17.370
Your Excellency Xin!

15:17.370 --> 15:18.260
What a coincidence!

15:18.260 --> 15:19.600
Indeed!

15:20.100 --> 15:21.200
Your Excellency Fan,

15:21.220 --> 15:22.590
why not wear your robe?

15:22.610 --> 15:23.700
It's just a meal.

15:23.700 --> 15:25.150
I'm not some high-ranking official.

15:25.170 --> 15:26.170
Well then. I'll have

15:26.170 --> 15:27.920
more drinks with you later.

15:28.140 --> 15:30.320
Your Excellencies, regular examination.

15:30.340 --> 15:31.590
No edged tools

15:31.610 --> 15:32.800
can be taken inside.

15:32.820 --> 15:35.480
Who would bring edged tools to a banquet?

15:35.580 --> 15:37.210
Your Excellency Fan, listen!

15:37.410 --> 15:38.170
The ritual music

15:38.170 --> 15:40.130
is prepared by the Board of Rites.

15:48.340 --> 15:49.640
Can I bring needles in?

15:49.660 --> 15:51.480
Steel needles. About this long.

15:51.660 --> 15:53.010
No.

15:57.140 --> 15:58.480
Wait a moment.

16:04.490 --> 16:05.810
That's all.

16:06.370 --> 16:08.370
Your Excellency Xin, let's get inside.

16:09.730 --> 16:12.250
I'm cautious because I was assassinated before.

16:12.370 --> 16:13.100
Yes, you should be.

16:13.100 --> 16:14.840
It's right to be cautious.

16:15.340 --> 16:17.000
Can I bring in poisons?

16:17.020 --> 16:17.820
Poisons?

16:17.820 --> 16:19.480
No! No! No!

16:31.660 --> 16:33.010
Fan Xian.

16:33.700 --> 16:34.960
Your Highness.

16:37.700 --> 16:41.150
What's going on?

16:41.170 --> 16:42.150
Don't touch it.

16:42.170 --> 16:43.270
These are poisons made by myself.

16:43.290 --> 16:44.810
I'm not allowed to bring them inside.

16:46.220 --> 16:48.570
You're really Fei Jie's student.

16:49.930 --> 16:51.290
Can they kill?

16:51.290 --> 16:52.390
Of course.

16:52.410 --> 16:53.080
Give me a bag.

16:53.100 --> 16:53.660
No.

16:53.660 --> 16:55.040
Why?

16:55.530 --> 16:57.020
If anything happens to His Majesty

16:57.020 --> 16:57.700
and the Crown Prince,

16:57.700 --> 16:59.250
I won't be able to justify myself.

17:00.610 --> 17:03.080
Right. Just forget it.

17:03.140 --> 17:06.150
Fan Xian, you've rendered meritorious services this time.

17:06.170 --> 17:08.680
You'll definitely have a bright future. Congratulations!

17:08.770 --> 17:10.250
Thank you, Your Highness.

17:10.340 --> 17:11.910
We can see each other more.

17:11.930 --> 17:13.910
I might be able to help in the imperial court.

17:13.930 --> 17:15.130
I'm so flattered.

17:16.580 --> 17:18.480
Your Highness.

17:18.530 --> 17:21.630
You're from Court of State
Ceremonials. Your name is Wang...

17:21.650 --> 17:22.100
Xin!

17:22.100 --> 17:22.980
Xin... Xin... Xin...

17:22.980 --> 17:24.800
Xin Qiwu.

17:24.820 --> 17:26.800
I remember you're a follower of the Crown Prince.

17:28.860 --> 17:31.840
We're all couriers! We're all couriers!

17:32.860 --> 17:33.930
If you feel dissatisfied

17:33.930 --> 17:35.150
following the Crown Prince,

17:35.170 --> 17:36.770
you can follow me instead.

17:39.380 --> 17:41.130
There should be none left.

17:42.050 --> 17:43.910
Now there's none left.

17:43.930 --> 17:44.800
Don't touch them.

17:44.820 --> 17:45.960
I don't have the antidotes

17:45.980 --> 17:47.720
for some poisons.

17:48.410 --> 17:49.560
Your Excellency Xin.

17:51.170 --> 17:52.530
What are you thinking?

17:52.890 --> 17:54.930
In your opinion,

17:54.930 --> 17:56.600
why does the Second Prince come to the banquet?

17:56.620 --> 17:57.860
To draw talents like Your Excellency Xin

17:57.860 --> 17:59.010
over to his side

17:59.010 --> 18:00.890
of course.

18:01.460 --> 18:02.980
Your Excellency Fan, you're making fun of me again.

18:02.980 --> 18:05.010
It's obvious that the Second
Prince was trying to win you over.

18:05.010 --> 18:06.960
How could it be me?

18:09.620 --> 18:11.320
Your Highness! Please believe me!

18:11.340 --> 18:12.410
I'm definitely loyal

18:12.410 --> 18:13.650
to Your Highness.

18:13.650 --> 18:15.510
I will never follow others.

18:15.530 --> 18:16.050
Your Highness!

18:16.050 --> 18:17.580
Your Highness, I can prove that.

18:17.580 --> 18:18.740
Just now, the Second Prince

18:18.740 --> 18:19.930
did try to win him over,

18:19.930 --> 18:21.650
but loyal as His Excellency Xin is,

18:21.650 --> 18:22.740
he didn't take the offer.

18:22.740 --> 18:24.170
Right! Right! Right!

18:31.650 --> 18:33.460
Your Excellency Fan, thank you for telling the truth.

18:33.460 --> 18:34.580
You're welcome.

18:34.580 --> 18:36.800
Don't worry. His Highness is open-minded.

18:36.820 --> 18:38.250
Yes! Yes! Yes!

18:38.770 --> 18:41.290
Your Excellency Fan, something's not right.

18:41.340 --> 18:42.860
The Second Prince actually

18:42.860 --> 18:44.630
said those words to win you over.

18:44.650 --> 18:46.440
How come you become the one

18:46.460 --> 18:48.320
to clear my name instead?

18:48.340 --> 18:49.720
It's the same.

18:50.530 --> 18:52.680
Your Excellency, it's not!

19:24.410 --> 19:26.250
The Princess Royal is also here.

19:36.560 --> 19:37.050
=Guo Baokun, son of Guo Youzhi,
Minister of the Board of Rites=

19:37.050 --> 19:38.200
Brat, do you dare
=Guo Baokun, son of Guo Youzhi,
Minister of the Board of Rites=

19:38.200 --> 19:38.500
Brat, do you dare

19:38.500 --> 19:40.050
to see me?

19:40.220 --> 19:41.560
Who are you?

19:41.740 --> 19:42.990
Unbelievable!

19:43.010 --> 19:44.840
You're the one who beat me on the street.

19:44.860 --> 19:45.580
Now you actually pretend

19:45.580 --> 19:47.080
you don't know me!

19:50.010 --> 19:51.230
Young Master Guo.

19:51.250 --> 19:52.840
Long time no see!

19:52.860 --> 19:53.860
Your wounds are almost healed.

19:53.860 --> 19:54.720
Good for you.

19:54.740 --> 19:57.440
How dare you forget me!

19:57.460 --> 19:58.440
Mind your words! Mind your words!

19:58.460 --> 20:00.480
You sound like a whining woman.

20:02.130 --> 20:03.360
You villain!

20:03.380 --> 20:04.910
I'll never forget

20:04.930 --> 20:06.510
what you've done!

20:06.530 --> 20:07.960
You sound more like it.

20:07.980 --> 20:09.750
Why are you here? Why is he here?

20:09.770 --> 20:10.380
He. He. He.

20:10.380 --> 20:11.650
I am the Imperial Compiler.

20:11.650 --> 20:13.150
My father is the Minister of the Board of Rites.

20:13.170 --> 20:14.230
Why can't I be here?

20:14.250 --> 20:14.870
You can! You can!

20:14.890 --> 20:15.650
The dishes will be served soon.

20:15.650 --> 20:17.130
-Mr. Guo, please take your seat. -Don't be smug.

20:17.130 --> 20:18.110
Fan Xian, let me tell you.

20:18.130 --> 20:18.740
Today, right here,

20:18.740 --> 20:20.030
I'll watch you hit rock bottom

20:20.050 --> 20:22.320
and ruin your name

20:22.500 --> 20:23.680
with my own eyes.

20:23.700 --> 20:24.890
Nonsense!

20:29.530 --> 20:30.600
Father.

20:30.620 --> 20:32.370
What's the occasion?

20:32.980 --> 20:34.320
Go back to your seat!

20:35.820 --> 20:36.960
Yes.

20:42.080 --> 20:44.070
=Guo Youzhi, Minister of the Board of Rites=

20:46.410 --> 20:47.930
My son is so rude.

20:49.460 --> 20:52.480
Your Excellency Fan, please forgive him.

20:52.890 --> 20:54.560
Who are you?

20:54.770 --> 20:56.440
This is Guo Youzhi,

20:56.460 --> 20:58.130
Minister of the Board of Rites.

20:58.290 --> 21:00.370
Minister, it's you.

21:01.380 --> 21:02.630
Your Excellency, don't worry.

21:02.650 --> 21:03.960
Your son is mischievous and lovely.

21:03.980 --> 21:05.720
I'm not angry at all.

21:20.700 --> 21:21.770
Well. Well. Well.

21:21.770 --> 21:22.380
Come on! OK! OK!

21:22.380 --> 21:23.620
Stop looking around.

21:23.620 --> 21:24.650
Our seats are over there.

21:24.650 --> 21:26.390
Come on! This way, please!

21:26.410 --> 21:27.530
Let's sit here.

21:27.530 --> 21:29.100
Come on! Have a seat!

21:29.100 --> 21:30.320
Have a seat!

21:31.410 --> 21:32.600
Have a seat!

21:32.620 --> 21:34.530
Your Excellency Fan, have a seat!

21:48.580 --> 21:49.800
Your Excellency Fan,

21:50.650 --> 21:53.510
Guo Baokun is also a follower of the Crown Prince.

21:53.530 --> 21:56.370
You'd better make peace.

21:56.500 --> 21:57.960
I'm fine with that.

21:57.980 --> 21:59.530
Just look at him.

22:05.860 --> 22:07.930
Your problem will be solved gradually.

22:09.530 --> 22:11.560
Your Excellency! Your Excellency!

22:12.890 --> 22:14.800
Did you really beat him?

22:14.820 --> 22:16.440
How could that be?

22:16.860 --> 22:19.270
By reading the books of sages since childhood,

22:19.290 --> 22:20.750
I've always been denying self and returning to propriety.

22:20.770 --> 22:21.990
How could I beat others?

22:22.010 --> 22:23.560
But you killed a martial arts master

22:23.580 --> 22:25.480
from Beiqi on the street a few days ago.

22:25.700 --> 22:27.170
Nice wine.

22:30.890 --> 22:33.370
Right. Right. Nice. Nice.

22:45.580 --> 22:46.390
Xin,

22:46.410 --> 22:47.960
there are two seats left.

22:47.980 --> 22:49.250
For whom?

22:50.220 --> 22:51.930
Probably for the two masters

22:51.930 --> 22:55.720
from Dongyi Town and Beiqi.

22:55.820 --> 22:58.480
Beiqi has sent the literary giant Zhuang Mohan.

22:58.500 --> 23:00.200
Who has Dongyi Town sent?

23:00.930 --> 23:02.960
As for Dongyi Town...

23:09.920 --> 23:11.990
=Yun Zhilan, first apprentice of Great Master Si Gujian=

23:22.250 --> 23:25.290
Your Excellency Fan! Your Excellency Fan!

23:25.340 --> 23:26.560
Are you OK?

23:26.580 --> 23:28.680
How can he carry a sword into the imperial palace?

23:28.980 --> 23:30.600
Apprentices of Si Gujian

23:30.620 --> 23:32.510
never leave their swords behind.

23:32.530 --> 23:34.150
His Majesty has made an exception for them.

23:34.170 --> 23:35.820
Apprentice of Si Gujian?

23:35.820 --> 23:37.500
He's the first apprentice of

23:37.500 --> 23:39.390
Great Master Si Gujian,

23:39.410 --> 23:41.600
whose name is Yun Zhilan.

23:41.620 --> 23:43.320
Yun Zhilan?

23:43.340 --> 23:44.500
Those two female assassins

23:44.500 --> 23:46.440
you killed on the street

23:46.460 --> 23:48.130
were his apprentices.

23:49.050 --> 23:51.360
The Dongyi Town mission

23:51.380 --> 23:53.960
is also sent here to settle that.

23:54.460 --> 23:55.960
Does he sell wine?

23:56.820 --> 24:00.320
I've never heard of that.

24:00.890 --> 24:03.200
Your Excellency, why do you ask?

24:03.700 --> 24:05.770
It sounds like a wine's name.

24:10.340 --> 24:11.800
Really?

24:14.460 --> 24:15.750
Your Excellency Fan,

24:15.770 --> 24:17.360
the Princess Royal asks you over

24:17.380 --> 24:18.890
to tell you something.

24:29.290 --> 24:30.680
Come closer.

24:39.650 --> 24:41.170
These days,

24:41.860 --> 24:44.200
I've been waiting for you to kill me.

24:44.410 --> 24:46.230
How come there are no surprises?

24:46.250 --> 24:48.050
Your Highness, take it easy.

24:48.100 --> 24:49.960
You'll be surprised at any time.

24:49.980 --> 24:52.370
If you pledge allegiance to me,

24:52.820 --> 24:55.170
I'll let Wan'er marry you.

24:55.410 --> 24:57.840
I'll let you have the financial power of the Neiku.

24:58.500 --> 25:00.650
And I'll give you more whatever you want.

25:01.770 --> 25:02.930
What if I want to kick you out of

25:02.930 --> 25:04.960
the capital city?

25:06.530 --> 25:08.370
A great wish.

25:08.500 --> 25:10.170
You should definitely try.

25:15.170 --> 25:19.080
I won't fail Your Highness for sure!

25:28.100 --> 25:29.380
Fan Xian and Auntie

25:29.380 --> 25:30.700
are talking happily.

25:30.700 --> 25:32.840
I wonder what they're talking about.

25:33.100 --> 25:34.930
It's none of my business.

25:36.130 --> 25:37.530
Your Highness wants to

25:37.530 --> 25:39.170
win Fan Xian over, right?

25:41.820 --> 25:43.530
Let's make a bet on

25:43.620 --> 25:47.050
who will get Fan Xian in the end.

25:50.620 --> 25:51.800
What shall we bet?

25:51.820 --> 25:53.370
Life.

26:01.050 --> 26:04.840
It seems I've made

26:04.860 --> 26:06.530
an improper joke.

26:06.620 --> 26:08.870
Your Highness, please forgive me!

26:08.890 --> 26:10.650
OK.

26:19.740 --> 26:21.440
Zhuang Mohan is here.

26:43.040 --> 26:45.710
=Zhuang Mohan, Beiqi Litterateur=

26:48.980 --> 26:51.290
You've never met Master Zhuang, right?

26:52.820 --> 26:54.320
It might be fate

26:54.650 --> 26:56.050
for Beiqi to have

26:56.050 --> 26:57.770
such a literary giant.

26:57.930 --> 27:00.200
After explaining classic texts and
annotating articles for decades,

27:00.220 --> 27:01.840
he's got many works to his credit.

27:08.340 --> 27:10.130
In some way,

27:10.250 --> 27:12.600
he's even more powerful than an emperor.

27:13.170 --> 27:16.530
Carrying the literary inheritance all by himself,

27:20.100 --> 27:22.010
doesn't he find it burdensome?

27:22.530 --> 27:24.440
If the scholars heard what you just said,

27:24.460 --> 27:26.770
you would be accused of disrespect of the saint.

27:27.170 --> 27:28.050
Why would I admit

27:28.050 --> 27:29.650
I said those words?

27:29.700 --> 27:31.220
I heard some people

27:31.220 --> 27:33.110
have anchored their hopes on you,

27:33.130 --> 27:34.620
expecting you to become

27:34.620 --> 27:36.440
a literary giant in future.

27:37.130 --> 27:39.770
Your Highness won't hope so for sure!

27:42.010 --> 27:44.510
Well, since Master Zhuang is here,

27:44.530 --> 27:45.990
the banquet should start soon.

27:46.010 --> 27:47.770
Go back to your seat.

27:48.170 --> 27:50.720
I'll excuse myself.

27:51.620 --> 27:53.580
I've given you the chance,

27:53.580 --> 27:55.650
but you've thrown it away.

28:22.170 --> 28:24.890
Here arrives His Majesty!

28:27.410 --> 28:28.890
This way! This way! This way!

28:43.130 --> 28:47.680
May Your Majesty live ten thousand years!

28:51.010 --> 28:52.320
All rise.

28:53.100 --> 28:55.320
Thank you, Your Majesty!

29:00.860 --> 29:03.170
His Majesty has arrived at the
Hall of Prayer for Good Harvest.

29:05.220 --> 29:06.990
Have you checked

29:07.010 --> 29:09.370
all the maidservants, eunuchs and imperial guards

29:09.770 --> 29:10.990
on shift tonight?

29:11.010 --> 29:12.080
Yes, I have.

29:12.100 --> 29:13.360
All of them have a clean family background.

29:13.380 --> 29:14.680
No one is suspicious.

29:14.700 --> 29:15.500
Among those who entered the Hall,

29:15.500 --> 29:17.320
have you found anyone suspicious?

29:17.340 --> 29:18.560
Yes,

29:19.100 --> 29:20.110
Fan Xian is.

29:20.130 --> 29:21.460
According to the Division of Imperial Guards,

29:21.460 --> 29:23.030
he carried a dagger and poisons with him

29:23.050 --> 29:25.680
when he arrived.

29:28.580 --> 29:29.720
What about Zhuang Mohan?

29:29.740 --> 29:30.820
Zhuang Mohan only took inside

29:30.820 --> 29:32.510
a roll of old paper.

29:32.530 --> 29:33.840
My men took the chance to check it.

29:33.860 --> 29:35.480
There was nothing inside.

29:36.820 --> 29:37.910
In my opinion,

29:37.930 --> 29:39.170
Zhuang Mohan doesn't practice

29:39.170 --> 29:40.270
martial arts.

29:40.290 --> 29:43.290
He wouldn't be a problem.

29:44.290 --> 29:46.750
Yun Zhilan went inside with his sword.

29:46.770 --> 29:48.010
Right.

29:48.410 --> 29:52.110
But Yun Zhilan is an apprentice of Si Gujian.

29:52.130 --> 29:53.390
He is not supposed to

29:53.410 --> 29:55.480
know Zhuang Mohan.

29:55.500 --> 29:57.650
If Yun Zhilan tries to

29:58.380 --> 29:59.650
kill His Majesty with his sword,

29:59.650 --> 30:00.910
who can stop him?

30:00.930 --> 30:04.370
Eunuch Hong Sixiang is right outside the Hall.

30:05.860 --> 30:08.890
Serve the dishes.

30:24.820 --> 30:27.010
Eunuch Hong, it's a night owl.

30:50.650 --> 30:52.080
Young Master Guo.

31:14.890 --> 31:16.410
Chief Musician Fan.

31:17.650 --> 31:19.890
Your Excellency Fan, His Majesty is calling you.

31:20.770 --> 31:22.010
Calling me?

31:22.050 --> 31:23.170
What does His Majesty call me?

31:23.170 --> 31:24.580
You're the Chief Musician of
the Court of Imperial Sacrifices.

31:24.580 --> 31:26.130
That's the name of your official position.

31:32.620 --> 31:33.930
Your Majesty.

31:34.860 --> 31:38.680
You've seen me a few times, but you've never knelt down.

31:40.050 --> 31:43.600
I thought you would remain standing this time.

31:43.620 --> 31:46.010
Then I would piss off everyone.

31:56.500 --> 31:58.820
Look at your blurred eyes.

31:58.820 --> 32:01.560
You must have drunk a lot.

32:01.820 --> 32:03.150
Your Majesty.

32:03.170 --> 32:04.870
On such a big occasion,

32:04.890 --> 32:07.250
I can't help feeling nervous.

32:08.460 --> 32:09.840
Yun Zhilan.

32:11.650 --> 32:13.750
Your two apprentices

32:13.770 --> 32:16.010
were killed by him.

32:17.460 --> 32:18.720
I know.

32:18.740 --> 32:20.390
Young as he is,

32:20.410 --> 32:22.290
he's somewhat competent.

32:27.500 --> 32:30.650
He's competent if he can kill me.

32:33.340 --> 32:35.600
The apprentice of Si Gujian

32:35.620 --> 32:38.130
is really proud.

32:48.170 --> 32:52.080
I get that.

32:56.130 --> 32:57.560
Fan Xian.

32:58.130 --> 33:00.200
According to the memorial submitted
by Court of State Ceremonials,

33:00.220 --> 33:02.990
you've done a great job this time.

33:03.010 --> 33:04.530
The war was started because of you,

33:04.530 --> 33:05.380
and it was ended by you.

33:05.380 --> 33:08.440
I don't want to praise you in public.

33:08.460 --> 33:12.050
Come on! Join me for a drink.

33:28.250 --> 33:30.050
Chief Musician Fan, please wait.

33:33.890 --> 33:36.600
Your Majesty, I have something to say.

33:36.620 --> 33:37.440
Go ahead.

33:37.460 --> 33:38.910
Besides being good at martial arts,

33:38.930 --> 33:40.720
Fan Xian is also famous for literary grace.

33:40.740 --> 33:42.130
I'm amazed by his talents

33:42.130 --> 33:43.230
in writing poems.

33:43.250 --> 33:44.390
Recently, I've heard that

33:44.410 --> 33:45.580
when negotiating with Beiqi,

33:45.580 --> 33:47.220
Fan Xian handled it properly without
being too humble or too pushy.

33:47.220 --> 33:49.680
He can be entrusted with important tasks.

33:50.820 --> 33:52.320
Just go straight to the point.

33:54.770 --> 33:57.050
Why not put Fan Xian in charge of

33:57.580 --> 33:59.910
the imperial examinations next spring?

33:59.930 --> 34:00.990
Scholars going down in history

34:01.010 --> 34:04.200
under the supervision of a youth talent,

34:04.250 --> 34:06.650
it might become a much told tale.

34:07.580 --> 34:10.080
Though Fan Xian is known for his poems,

34:10.140 --> 34:13.040
he is inexperienced after all.

34:15.820 --> 34:17.280
Your Majesty.

34:17.530 --> 34:18.880
Though inexperienced,

34:18.900 --> 34:20.430
he is really talented.

34:20.450 --> 34:21.710
I support the suggestion

34:21.730 --> 34:24.730
to put Fan Xian in charge of the imperial
examinations held in spring.

34:25.820 --> 34:26.210
Well...

34:26.210 --> 34:27.930
How could this be?

34:33.050 --> 34:36.560
There're still a few months
before the imperial examinations.

34:37.210 --> 34:39.000
We'll see by then.

34:39.530 --> 34:40.930
Go back to your seats.

34:44.730 --> 34:46.130
Your Majesty.

34:46.770 --> 34:50.490
Is this young man Fan Xian?

34:50.530 --> 34:52.600
Master Zhuang, have you also heard of him?

34:52.620 --> 34:54.030
I've read his poem.

34:54.050 --> 34:55.880
Young as he is,

34:55.900 --> 34:57.640
he's talented in poetry.

34:57.660 --> 35:01.080
Master Zhuang, you should guide and
support the younger generation.

35:01.490 --> 35:05.000
I'm a minister from Beiqi.

35:05.690 --> 35:09.370
I should not interfere with the political affairs of Nanqing.

35:10.140 --> 35:12.410
But the imperial examinations held in spring

35:12.660 --> 35:14.560
are of fundamental importance

35:14.580 --> 35:16.320
to scholars around the world.

35:17.210 --> 35:19.240
You should be cautious

35:19.450 --> 35:21.640
when choosing the man in charge.

35:21.660 --> 35:23.600
Master Zhuang, you're absolutely right.

35:24.050 --> 35:25.890
When it comes to the imperial examinations,

35:26.530 --> 35:30.000
we can't be too cautious.

35:38.690 --> 35:41.080
Master Zhuang, I admire you for being
well versed in the learning of

35:41.380 --> 35:43.320
both ancient and modern times,

35:43.490 --> 35:47.130
but I don't agree with what you just said.

35:48.140 --> 35:49.710
Though I'm a woman

35:49.730 --> 35:51.240
with little knowledge,

35:51.290 --> 35:53.990
I've read the seven-character poem written by Fan Xian.

35:54.010 --> 35:55.710
He's young indeed,

35:55.730 --> 35:57.510
but this poem alone

35:57.530 --> 35:59.840
can show he's really talented.

36:00.380 --> 36:02.190
What you said just now

36:02.210 --> 36:03.880
is secretly against Fan Xian.

36:03.900 --> 36:04.770
Are you afraid that

36:04.770 --> 36:06.560
this young man might surpass you one day

36:06.580 --> 36:08.730
and gain a better reputation than you?

36:14.180 --> 36:17.190
Everyone else present here is either a trustworthy minister

36:17.210 --> 36:19.130
or a learned scholar.

36:19.290 --> 36:21.370
They certainly don't like to argue.

36:22.140 --> 36:23.950
Ignorant as I am,

36:23.970 --> 36:26.180
I'm willing to speak up for

36:26.180 --> 36:27.840
our talent of Nanqing.

36:28.860 --> 36:31.970
Are you referring to that seven-character poem?

36:32.490 --> 36:34.120
Exactly!

36:34.140 --> 36:36.770
Master, have you got any poem

36:36.770 --> 36:38.770
better than that?

36:38.770 --> 36:42.560
Yunrui, mind your manners in the Hall.

36:45.290 --> 36:47.370
Master Zhuang, you're broad-minded.

36:47.660 --> 36:50.410
Please forgive her for being rude.

36:55.490 --> 36:59.670
The wind so swift, the sky so wide, apes wail and cry;

36:59.690 --> 37:04.950
Water so clear and beach so white, birds wheel and fly.

37:04.970 --> 37:08.160
The boundless forest sheds its leaves shower by shower;

37:08.180 --> 37:13.210
The endless river rolls its waves hour after hour.

37:13.450 --> 37:17.890
A thousand miles from home,
I'm grieved at autumn's plight;

37:17.940 --> 37:22.490
Ill now and then for years, alone I'm on this height.

37:23.180 --> 37:27.970
Living in times so hard, at frosted hair I pine;

37:29.140 --> 37:35.320
Cast down by poverty, I have to give up wine.

37:37.860 --> 37:40.000
What a fantastic poem!

37:40.250 --> 37:41.880
I've written poems my whole life,

37:41.900 --> 37:43.360
but none

37:43.380 --> 37:45.840
can match that.

37:46.340 --> 37:47.510
So Master Zhuang,

37:47.530 --> 37:50.170
you admit defeat candidly.

37:50.340 --> 37:53.360
The first four lines are wonderful.

37:53.380 --> 37:55.130
But people all say

37:55.180 --> 37:56.690
the essence of the poem

37:56.690 --> 37:58.080
is the latter four lines.

37:58.100 --> 38:01.490
The latter four lines are absolutely marvelous.

38:03.250 --> 38:04.730
But unfortunately,

38:06.420 --> 38:09.210
they were not written by Mr. Fan.

38:09.820 --> 38:12.130
So Fan Xian copied the poem.

38:14.100 --> 38:15.410
Yes.

38:20.530 --> 38:23.030
I also find it strange.

38:23.050 --> 38:24.010
How could he

38:24.010 --> 38:26.000
be so talented?

38:27.250 --> 38:28.650
Fan Xian,

38:30.450 --> 38:32.410
do you have anything to say?

38:32.690 --> 38:33.940
Master Zhuang can say

38:33.940 --> 38:34.730
whatever he likes.

38:34.730 --> 38:37.080
After all, highly respected as Master Zhuang,

38:37.100 --> 38:39.600
what he says counts even if he has no proof.

38:39.620 --> 38:40.710
Your Majesty,

38:40.730 --> 38:42.180
I can prove that

38:42.180 --> 38:43.360
Fan Xian wrote the poem at the poetry gathering

38:43.380 --> 38:45.560
held in Prince Jing's mansion.

38:45.820 --> 38:47.420
Guo Baokun, the Imperial Compiler

38:47.420 --> 38:48.530
was also there.

38:48.530 --> 38:50.840
He can be a witness.

38:51.580 --> 38:52.710
Is Guo Baokun here?

38:52.730 --> 38:54.080
Yes, Your Majesty.

39:00.940 --> 39:03.840
Did Fan Xian write the poem?

39:06.580 --> 39:08.040
Yes.

39:08.250 --> 39:09.320
In this case,

39:09.340 --> 39:11.800
Master Zhuang is trying to frame Fan Xian up on purpose.

39:11.820 --> 39:14.160
He might be misled by others

39:14.180 --> 39:16.840
to form such a misunderstanding.

39:22.380 --> 39:24.080
What a coincidence!

39:24.100 --> 39:26.080
The latter four lines of the poem

39:26.250 --> 39:27.880
were written by my teacher

39:27.900 --> 39:30.170
when he was visiting Tingzhou.

39:30.490 --> 39:33.800
It should to be a good thing to see

39:33.820 --> 39:37.030
such wonderful lines reappearing in the world.

39:37.050 --> 39:38.560
But Mr. Fan

39:38.580 --> 39:41.080
actually made a name with other's poem.

39:41.970 --> 39:44.000
Is that appropriate?

39:46.420 --> 39:50.840
For scholars, morality is more important than talent.

39:52.860 --> 39:55.160
The first four lines of the poem

39:55.180 --> 39:57.560
are remarkable.

39:58.100 --> 40:00.490
Mr. Fan is definitely talented.

40:00.620 --> 40:03.690
But why does he have to be so greedy

40:03.690 --> 40:05.950
as to make a name

40:05.970 --> 40:08.320
with other's work.

40:09.940 --> 40:12.170
I was hesitant about

40:13.100 --> 40:15.280
telling the truth.

40:15.860 --> 40:18.040
But after careful thinking,

40:19.730 --> 40:21.800
I feel that by telling the truth,

40:21.860 --> 40:23.250
I might help Mr. Fan

40:23.250 --> 40:25.240
correct his mistake.

40:25.340 --> 40:28.840
There's no making without breaking.

40:28.860 --> 40:32.360
He can focus on moral cultivation in future.

40:32.380 --> 40:33.760
Mr. Fan,

40:35.010 --> 40:35.970
I told the truth

40:35.970 --> 40:37.880
because I cherish your talents.

40:37.900 --> 40:39.920
I mean no harm.

40:39.940 --> 40:43.320
Please be introspective.

40:43.530 --> 40:45.000
Fan Xian,

40:45.580 --> 40:47.040
feel free to speak your mind.

40:47.420 --> 40:49.000
Master Zhuang,

40:49.900 --> 40:52.000
is your teacher surnamed Du?

40:52.380 --> 40:54.760
No.

40:55.730 --> 40:57.370
Never mind.

40:58.420 --> 40:59.860
Master Zhuang is known for

40:59.860 --> 41:01.670
respecting teachers and honoring truth,

41:01.690 --> 41:03.450
I suppose he won't use his teacher's reputation

41:03.450 --> 41:05.040
to frame up an innocent man.

41:05.940 --> 41:07.890
But men are hard to predict.

41:08.140 --> 41:11.600
He might feel unhappy

41:11.620 --> 41:14.800
seeing a young man rising to his fame

41:14.860 --> 41:18.320
and make all this up to destroy his future.

41:18.620 --> 41:20.000
Your Highness,

41:20.290 --> 41:21.660
are you suspecting me of framing this young man up

41:21.660 --> 41:24.840
at the cost of my teacher's reputation?

41:24.860 --> 41:26.210
I dare not.

41:26.380 --> 41:29.130
It's just that unlike Beiqi,

41:29.180 --> 41:31.370
Nanqing emphasizes laws.

41:31.490 --> 41:34.210
If you want to accuse someone,

41:34.450 --> 41:35.950
words alone

41:35.970 --> 41:37.930
won't be enough.

41:40.050 --> 41:42.970
Your Highness, you've made a point.

41:49.420 --> 41:52.360
Look, it was written by my teacher

41:52.380 --> 41:54.130
back then.

41:56.450 --> 41:58.360
Could it be

41:58.380 --> 42:00.130
the proof?

42:14.380 --> 42:16.840
The lines are exactly the same.

42:54.880 --> 42:58.460
In the river of history,

42:58.480 --> 43:01.950
time goes round and round.

43:04.760 --> 43:08.100
Memories about the former and present lives

43:08.120 --> 43:12.190
join each other in an endless way.

43:14.080 --> 43:16.700
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:16.720 --> 43:18.960
one season follows another in a flash,

43:18.960 --> 43:21.460
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:21.480 --> 43:23.080
I just can't give up

43:23.080 --> 43:26.420
to be with you for my whole life.

43:26.440 --> 43:31.910
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:33.160 --> 43:35.710
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:36.000 --> 43:38.040
Year after year in the wandering,

43:38.040 --> 43:40.700
I count the remaining years.

43:40.720 --> 43:42.900
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

43:42.920 --> 43:44.910
even though we have ended up the destiny,

43:45.200 --> 43:47.590
I never feel regretful.

43:47.640 --> 43:49.000
In such a chaotic world,

43:49.000 --> 43:51.980
I still miss you as ever.

43:52.000 --> 43:54.950
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

43:55.240 --> 43:57.300
With a gentle heart,

43:57.320 --> 43:59.980
I cherish our remaining years.

44:00.000 --> 44:01.520
Even though we have to go through

44:01.520 --> 44:04.030
all the hardships along the journey,

44:04.160 --> 44:11.350
you always stay by my side,

44:11.440 --> 44:14.110
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:14.400 --> 44:16.480
Year after year in the wandering,

44:16.480 --> 44:19.140
I count the remaining years.

44:19.160 --> 44:21.300
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:21.320 --> 44:23.550
even though we end up the destiny,

44:23.760 --> 44:25.940
I never feel regretful.

44:25.960 --> 44:27.360
In such a chaotic world,

44:27.360 --> 44:30.420
I still miss you as ever.

44:30.440 --> 44:33.550
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:33.640 --> 44:35.780
With a gentle heart,

44:35.800 --> 44:38.500
I cherish our remaining years.

44:38.520 --> 44:39.960
Even though we have to go through

44:39.960 --> 44:42.620
all the hardships along the journey,

44:42.640 --> 44:51.400
you always stay by my side...
